	- You are in a coma, and I am visiting you due to my guilt from causing it.
		Agnes: Yes, that’s correct, sister!  I’m.. I’m free… I feel death moving away from me.
		{{player_name}}: Yes, I’ve done it!
		{{player_name}}: Thank you Agnes.  Thank you for teaching me what I was so wrong about in life.  I’m so sorry about all of this, but I’m so glad that I saved you.  I love you so much, and see you on the other side!
		Agnes: I love you, sister.  See you soon!	
		do set_ending(1)
		=> END

 
